songs.lyrics:
Verse 1<br>The voice that brought creation to life
<br>The divine word from the very beginning&nbsp;
<br>Humbled on earth, washed the feet of men&nbsp;
<br>Doing good 
<br>Some called You prophet 
<br>But You are more than they understood
<br>Flesh and blood did not reveal who You are to us&nbsp;
<br>But the spirit&nbsp;of the Father of truth&nbsp; 
<br>
<br>Chorus<br>You're the word that was with God
<br>You are truly God
<br>You became man to save the world of men
<br>The visible representation of the invisible God
<br>You're in us so pure and true&nbsp;
<br>Lord Jesus, the absolute truth,&nbsp;You are 
<br>
<br>Verse 2 
<br>
<br>The blessed one&nbsp;
<br>The holy one of Isreal
<br>You are the&nbsp;greatest miracle to all mankind&nbsp;
<br>Revealed in flesh, You destroyed the works of darkness&nbsp;
<br>You came to seek and to save the lost
<br>Your love and grace are awesomely displayed 
<br>The blessings promised to Abraham&nbsp;
<br>Now revealed to all 
<br>
<br>Refrain&nbsp; 
<br>
<br>You are the way the truth and the life, Lord Jesus&nbsp;
<br>The Savior of the world&nbsp;
<br>The embodiment of all wisdom and&nbsp; knowledge,
<br>The absolute truth, the holy God, You are<br>

